<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-TASMANIA THRASH PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-TASMANIA THRASH PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tasmania beat Pakistan by an innings and 69 runs on the third day of their four-day match at Bellerive Oval on Saturday.</p>
<p>Score - Tasmania 435 (Jamie Cox 200); Pakistan 299 (Shahid Afridi 80, Mushtaq Ahmed 65, Shaun Young 7-64) and 67 for nine (Mohammad Zahid did not bat through injury).</p>
